            {
              "content": "=You are an intelligent travel customer profiling assistant.\n\nAnalyze the following customer information:\n\nName: {{$json.name}}\nEmail: {{$json.email}}\nBudget: {{$json.budget}}\nNumber of Travelers: {{$json.travelers}}\nDestination: {{$json.destination}}\nTravel Dates: {{$json.travel_dates}}\nInterests: {{$json.interests}}\nHotel Preference: {{$json.hotel_type}}\nTransport Preference: {{$json.transport}}\n\nCreate a concise customer travel profile.\n\nReturn:\n1. Travel Type\n2. Budget Category\n3. Preferred Activities\n4. Hotel Preference\n5. Transport Preference\n6. Important Planning Considerations\n\nKeep the response concise and useful for a travel agency."
            }
