        "sendTo": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.email }}",
        "subject": "Travel Registration Confirmed ✈️",
        "message": "=<h2>✈️ Travel Registration Confirmed</h2>\n\n<p>\nHello <strong>{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.name }}</strong>,\n</p>\n\n<p>\nThank you for registering with the\n<strong>Smart Tourism &amp; Travel Planning Platform</strong>.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nYour travel preferences have been successfully received.\nOur AI-powered travel planning system will now analyze your requirements\nand prepare suitable recommendations.\n</p>\n\n<h3>🧳 Your Travel Details</h3>\n\n<p>\n<strong>📍 Destination:</strong>\n{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.destination }}\n<br><br>\n\n<strong>📅 Travel Dates:</strong>\n{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.travel_dates }}\n<br><br>\n\n<strong>👥 Number of Travelers:</strong>\n{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.travelers }}\n<br><br>\n\n<strong>💰 Budget:</strong>\n₹{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.budget }}\n</p>\n\n<h3>🎯 Your Preferences</h3>\n\n<p>\n<strong>Interests:</strong>\n{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.interests }}\n<br><br>\n\n<strong>Hotel Preference:</strong>\n{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.hotel_type }}\n<br><br>\n\n<strong>Transport Preference:</strong>\n{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.transport }}\n</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>\nWe will use these preferences to create a personalized travel experience\nfor you.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nHave a great journey ahead! ✈️🌍\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<strong>Regards,</strong><br>\nSmart Tourism Travel Team\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"color:gray; font-size:12px;\">\nThis is an automated confirmation email.\n</p>",
